        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_b0d5f242-18f7-4dda-b933-e4275ec88335">
            <semantic:text>I use tools such as DAT One, watch Freight waves, and use carrier history when booking loads. Building a carrier relationship is very important because the less time I have to work on booking a load, the more time I can spend covering other loads and do my follow up work on load. So I spend time asking carriers what lanes they run, how often, and questions just to get an understanding of what the carrier is looking for. I try to find loads that land in areas where my other loads are delivering so I can keep a carrier busy.</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
    </semantic:process>
